<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African February gold/forex reserves detailed.</title>
<headline>S.African February gold/forex reserves detailed.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank on Friday released a detailed breakdown of its gold and foreign exchange reserves as at February 28 1997.</p>
<p>The headline figure of 12.5 billion rand was announced on Tuesday evening.</p>
<p>(Rand million)	    Feb '97	     Jan '97     Feb '96</p>
<p>Assets:</p>
<p>Gold		    5311.23	     5534.37     6626.26</p>
<p>Foreign		 7183.23	     6228.09     8090.49</p>
<p>Total		  12494.46	    11762.46    14716.75</p>
<p>Gold shr of total     42.50  pct	  47.05	 45.02</p>
<p>Gold volume		3.71  million oz	3.84	  4.78</p>
<p>Gold value	    1432.36  rand/oz  1441.08     1385.62</p>
<p>Other liabilities	8.14  bln rand    5.95	  4.97</p>
<p>Total liabilities     35.58  bln rand   35.14	 32.94</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)</p>
</text>
